  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/04/IMG_8624.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>La Orkesta Pelillo, con sus particulares versiones de punk-rock, ha ofrecido un extraordinario y multitudinario concierto la noche de este viernes en la Cafeter&iacute;a Druida de la calle Ausi&agrave;s March, 45 de Onda. La particularidad de esta actuaci&oacute;n es que ha habido dos bater&iacute;as: Toni Lonjedo Barcel&oacute;, en la primera parte, y Aleix Peris Fern&aacute;ndez, el titular, en la segunda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillodruida030415/img_8549.jpg\" alt=\"img_8549\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillodruida030415/img_8550.jpg\" alt=\"img_8550\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillodruida030415/img_8551.jpg\" alt=\"img_8551\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillodruida030415/img_8552.jpg\" alt=\"img_8552\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillodruida030415/img_8553.jpg\" alt=\"img_8553\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillodruida030415/img_8554.jpg\" alt=\"img_8554\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillodruida030415/img_8556.jpg\" alt=\"img_8556\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillodruida030415/img_8557.jpg\" alt=\"img_8557\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8